  "updated_at": "2026-03-28",
  "bio": "Lena, also known by her artistic moniker Lisa Englund, is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Stockholm, Sweden, specializing in illustrative, fineline, and minimalist tattoos done with vegan ink. She is renowned for her exceptional cleanliness, ensuring each client enjoys a safe and pristine tattooing environment at the cozy Narval Studio in Sandsborg. Her dedication to maintaining a sterile workspace exemplifies her utmost professionalism in the craft of handpoked tattoos.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Stockholm, Stockholm County, Sweden\n\n🪄 HANDPOKE AND MACHINE TATTOOS\n💌 boka via DM med motiv, storlek, placering\n❕ contact.le.pokes@gmail.com\n📍 @narval.studio sthlm\n🫧 @lisa.englund",
